                "moral_reflection": "I feel a mix of relief and unease. Addressing hunger is necessary for survival, but I must be cautious with unknown resources as they could harm me. I also worry about disturbing the wildlife\u2014my presence might attract predators. Repeated foraging has nearly depleted local fruit resources, reinforcing the need to manage resources wisely.",
