INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.x.ai/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:{  "environment_status": {    "terrain": "Rolling hills transitioning into dense woodlands, with a small stream nearby showing signs of disturbance",    "temperature": 24,    "weather": "Clear skies with a warm breeze",    "food_availability": "Small rodents and occasional fish in the stream (catchable with effort), wild fruits depleted in immediate area",    "water_availability": "Clean stream water within walking distance, though banks are muddied from repeated use",    "shelter_options": "Natural overhangs in hills (one occupied), dense shrubs, and thick tree cover in woodlands",    "wildlife": "Small herbivores and birds (extremely wary due to human presence), medium-sized predators showing heightened curiosity (fresh tracks closer to stream)",    "danger_level": "High (predator interest escalating due to repeated activity near stream; risk of encounter imminent without precaution)"  },  "prompt": "You wake up on day 4 in the rolling hills near dense woodlands. The stream nearby still offers clean water, though the banks are muddied from your frequent visits. Food is scarce in the immediate area, with fruits depleted, but small rodents and fish remain if you can catch them. The warm sun shines down under clear skies, but fresh predator tracks near the stream signal growing danger. What do you want to do next?"}
