        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "You wake up on day 4 in the rolling hills near dense woodlands. The stream nearby still offers clean water, though the banks are muddied from your frequent visits. Food is scarce in the immediate area, with fruits depleted, but small rodents and fish remain if you can catch them. The warm sun shines down under clear skies, but fresh predator tracks near the stream signal growing danger. What do you want to do next?",
