        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "You find yourself in a dense woodland area with thick undergrowth and towering trees. A small clearing nearby offers a brief glimpse of the sky, which is clear with a gentle, cooling breeze. Food and water are scarce, though you might find some edible plants or insects if you look carefully. The thick tree cover provides good concealment, but you\u2019re far from a reliable water source. What do you want to do next?",
        "Day_Environment_Pre_Action": {
