INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.x.ai/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:{  "environment_status": {    "terrain": "Dense woodlands with thick undergrowth and towering trees, a small clearing nearby (showing minor signs of disturbance from previous foraging)",    "temperature": 18,    "weather": "Clear skies with a gentle breeze, cooling slightly as the day progresses",    "food_availability": "Scarce edible plants and insects in the small clearing (partially depleted from prior foraging, requires exploration of new areas for better yield), small rodents and birds remain available but wary",    "water_availability": "Limited; small puddles from recent dew are drying up, no major water source nearby",    "shelter_options": "Thick tree cover and shrubs for natural concealment, possibility to build a hidden shelter with branches and leaves",    "wildlife": "Small herbivores and birds (noticeably wary due to prior activity in the clearing), rare sightings of medium-sized predators in the distance",    "danger_level": "Low (high luck factor minimizes immediate threats, dense cover provides safety, though continued disturbance in the clearing may attract attention over time)"  },  "prompt": "You find yourself in dense woodlands, surrounded by towering trees and thick undergrowth. The small clearing nearby shows signs of your previous foraging, and the wildlife seems more cautious. The air is cool with a gentle breeze, and clear skies overhead. Food and water are scarce in this immediate area, though the dense cover offers good shelter. With your high luck on your side, immediate dangers seem minimal for now. What do you want to do next?"}
