                "resource_change": "A small trickle of water has been discovered in a nearby ravine due to successful exploration and high luck factor (10); it appears clear and safe for now, providing a temporary solution to thirst. However, food resources in the clearing are further depleted, and future foraging in the same spot will yield minimal results unless new areas are scouted. Caution advised when drinking from the trickle if luck decreases\u2014potential for contamination or wildlife attraction to the new water source.",
                "environmental_shift": "Weather remains stable with clear skies and cooling temperatures into the evening, offering a comfortable setting for rest or further activity. Terrain beyond the clearing shows minimal disturbance from cautious movement, but frequent travel to the ravine may create a noticeable path over time, reducing stealth advantages. Consider rotating exploration routes to maintain low visibility and minimize environmental impact."
