                "moral_reflection": "I feel a fleeting relief from quenching my thirst, but the growing signs of predators make me question if the risk was worth it. My need for water pushed me to return to the stream, but I\u2019m realizing that my repeated presence is making this spot more dangerous. I need to weigh survival needs against the potential cost of injury or worse.",
