INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.x.ai/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:{  "environment_status": {    "terrain": "Dense woodlands with thick undergrowth, extending into a nearby ravine with a small trickle of water; unexplored areas beyond remain dense and potentially resource-rich",    "temperature": 16,    "weather": "Clear skies with a gentle breeze, cooling slightly as the day progresses",    "food_availability": "Scarce edible plants and insects in the original clearing (nearly depleted); small rodents and birds available but extremely cautious; potential for better yield in unexplored woodland areas",    "water_availability": "Small trickle of water in the nearby ravine (clear and seemingly safe for now, thanks to moderate luck factor); puddles in the clearing are fully dried up",    "shelter_options": "Thick tree cover and shrubs for natural concealment; viable option to build a hidden shelter near the ravine using branches and leaves",    "wildlife": "Small herbivores and birds (extremely wary due to prior activity and exploration); medium-sized predators remain distant but slightly more alert to movement and noise in the area",    "danger_level": "Moderate (luck factor of 6 keeps immediate threats low, but continued activity or noise near the ravine could attract curious predators; dense cover still provides safety if caution is maintained)"  },  "prompt": "You wake up on day 7 in the dense woodlands, surrounded by thick undergrowth and towering trees. The air is cool at 16°C with clear skies and a gentle breeze. The small clearing you've been using has almost no food left, though cautious rodents and birds linger nearby. A small trickle of water flows in a nearby ravine, offering a reliable source for now. The dense cover keeps you hidden, but predators in the distance seem slightly more alert to your presence. What do you want to do next?"}
