                "resource_change": "No significant change in food or water resources during shelter construction; water trickle in the ravine remains clear and safe for now due to moderate luck factor (6), but frequent visits may risk contamination or attract wildlife if caution isn't maintained. Shelter materials (branches and leaves) have been gathered, slightly altering the immediate ravine area's natural cover.",
