        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "You wake up on day 7 in the dense woodlands, surrounded by thick undergrowth and towering trees. The air is cool at 16\u00b0C with clear skies and a gentle breeze. The small clearing you've been using has almost no food left, though cautious rodents and birds linger nearby. A small trickle of water flows in a nearby ravine, offering a reliable source for now. The dense cover keeps you hidden, but predators in the distance seem slightly more alert to your presence. What do you want to do next?",
