        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "You wake up on day 8 in the dense woodlands, the air slightly warmer under clear skies with a gentle breeze. Your hidden shelter near the ravine keeps you secure, and the small trickle of water nearby remains clear. Food in the immediate clearing is scarce, though unexplored areas of the woodland might hold more resources. Small animals and birds are extremely cautious, and medium-sized predators linger at a distance, slightly more aware of your presence. With your high luck today, the environment feels a bit more forgiving. What do you want to do next?",
